2 CONT * 1. Theodor Melvin b. 25 May 1887 Fillmore County Minnesota d. 14 Jun 1887 Fillmore County Minnesota
2 CONT * 2. Arnold b. 04 Jun 1892 Fillmore County Minnesota d. 10 Sep 1958 Fillmore County Minnesota m. Nettie Lund 06 Sep 1922
2 CONT
2 CONT SOLAND--On Friday morning June 10th 1892, of blood poisoning, Mrs. E. T. Soland, aged 26 years Deceased had become a mother five days before her death and up to twenty-four hours before the sad event took place seemed to be recove
2 CONC ring rapidly. She was the daughter of Mr. and Mrs. Sylvester Topness, of Holt township, and was buried Sunday in the Ellestad cemetery, a very large concourse of friends gathering there to pay their last respects to her memory. Mr
2 CONC s. Soland was universally respected by all her acquaintances. She leaves beside her husband and infant child, a father and mother and many other relatives to mourn her death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elstad Lutheran Church baptism records, p. 55 #4, Anne born 7 Mai 66 baptized 15 Juni 1866 at Elstad Solfest Tollefsen og H. Berte Larsdatter Sponsors: Bertel Thoresen, Iver Gulbrandsen, Berte Knudsdatter, Karen Larsdatter, Berte 
2 CONC Larsdatter.
2 CONT
