1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mrs Minnie Seburg, 72, 2944 Nicollet Avenue, Minneapolis, Minnesota died Friday, February 16, 1951. Burial in Crystal Lake Cemetery.            
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Seburg was born in Fillmore County, Minnesota, and had been a Minneapolis, Minnesota, resident 50 years.     
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving are her husband, John; two daughters, Mrs Alfred Hagen and Mrs Russell Doetz; a son, John Milton Seburg, and two grandchildren, all of Minneapolis, Minnesota.            
2 CONT
2 CONT Also a sister, Mrs Hattie Gift, Hollywood California and three brothers, George Henderson, Halstad, Minnesota; Clarence Henderson, Potlatch, Idaho; and Joseph Henderson, Hollywood California.
2 CONT ----
