1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Odd Nordbo
2 CONT
2 CONT Loving husband, father and grandfather passed away at home September 26, 2017. Born October 5, 1934 in Fiskaa, Norway. He is survived by his wife of 59 years, Valborg; his daughters Anne Marie and Marit, and granddaughters Hanna M
