1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Joseph P. Graba''' is a former member of the Minnesota House of Representatives, hailing from a political family spanning multiple generations. He also served as deputy commissioner of the Minnesota Department o
2 CONC f Education, director of the Minnesota State Board of Vocational Technical Education, and deputy executive director and later interim executive director of the Minnesota Higher Education Coordinating Board. He was also a staff mem
2 CONC ber for the United States Congress. All of his political work was as a member of the Democratic-Farmer-Labor Party.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the father of twin noted gymnastics coaches Jeff Graba and Jess Graba.
2 CONT
