1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RUSHFORD, MN - Isabel "Izzy" H. Johnson, 93, of Rushford, MN died on Tuesday, May 19, 2020, at Winona Health in Winona, MN. 
2 CONT Izzy was born on November 3, 1926, in Lanesboro, MN to Selmer and Mary (Gullilckson) Topness. She was raised on the Topness family farm in the Highland area. On November 23, 1946, she was united in marriage with Conrad Johnson at 
2 CONC Highland Prairie Lutheran Church in rural Peterson, MN. Izzy and Conrad farmed in the Highland and Oak Ridge areas for many years until they retired in Money Creek, MN in 1971. 
2 CONT Isabel was a very sweet lady who loved animals. 
2 CONT She is survived by her children: Gary Johnson of Rochester, MN, Greg (Deanna) Johnson of Winona, MN Terry Johnson of St. Louis Park, MN, and Jerry Johnson of Goodview, MN; a daughter-in law, Lynn Johnson of West Salem, WI; grandch
2 CONC ildren: Jamie (Nikki) Johnson, Benjamin (Aubrey) Johnson, Christopher (Kayla) Johnson, Abigail (Clinton) Charles, and Nathaniel Johnson; and by four great-grandchildren: Hunter Conrad Johnson, Taylor Johnson, Camille Gale Marie Ch
2 CONC arles, and Ava Marr; and by many nieces and nephews.
2 CONT Izzy was preceded in death by her husband; one son, Gale; brothers: Leonard, Clarence and Sidney Topness; and by a sister, Minerva Thompson. 
2 CONT There will be a private family graveside service at Elstad Lutheran Cemetery in rural Lanesboro, MN.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/210314197/isabel_helen-johnson Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/pr
