1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-296975231-1-500401/evelyn-henrietta-schiff-born-nesvig-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-e5468e176d89d1363f31539e0b0bf59a&mrid=dce447b7fb
