1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Youngest child of Conrad A Gaard and Seraphine G Larson, born 8-16-1942, Elmore, MN.
2 CONT Christened 10-25-42, Shiloh Lutheran Church, Elmore, MN.
2 CONT Attended Cleveland Consolidated School District #2.
2 CONT Graduated from St. Peter High School, St. Peter, MN. Class of 1960.
2 CONT Served in the U.S. Army from 6-27-1960 to 6-26-1963. Attended Transportation school(Single Engine Airplane Repair-13 weeks) at Fort Eustis, VA and USAAS school(Multi-Engine Observation Airplane Maintenance-4 weeks) at Fort Rucker,
2 CONC  AL graduating first in his class on 5-25-1962. Stationed at Fort Carson, Colorado Springs, CO to 5th Infantry Division as a Grumman Mohawk crew chief. Achieved the rank of Specialist 5, E-5. Received Honorable Discharge on 5-30-1
2 CONC 966.
2 CONT Married Carolyn A Dawley, 4-22-61. Divorced.
2 CONT Completed numerous Machinist related courses at the William Hood Dunwoody Industrial Institute, Minneapolis, MN.
2 CONT Married Alanna Jane Henke, 10-10-64. Adopted a female Pekingese, named her Mitseisu. Had son, Gavin Eric Gaard, 8-28-67. Divorced after 21 year marriage. Had a friendly lasting relationship and was in communication with Alanna unt
2 CONC il his passing.
2 CONT Worked for Hewlett Packard(HP), Colorado Springs, CO as a Tool & Die Maker, 5-1966 to 1-1988. Celebrated 20 Years of Service at HP on 12-18-1986.
2 CONT Worked for D. R. Tool & Die, Inc., Minneapolis, MN for over 15 as a Tool & Die Maker.
2 CONT Enjoyed attending and watching NASCAR, World of Outlaws, and NHRA races. Attended the 2007 Formula 1 United States Grand Prix at the Indianapolis Motor Speedway. Spent NASCAR race days at the Atlanta Motor Speedway, Las Vegas Moto
2 CONC r Speedway(LVMS), and Talladega Superspeedway. Also saw race events at Pikes Peak Speedway, Colorado Springs International Speedway, Colorado National Speedway, Brainerd Raceway, Cedar Lake Speedway, Gainesville Raceway, Bandimere
2 CONC  Speedway, the Dirt Track at LVMS.
2 CONT Cheered for the University of Minnesota football and hockey teams, the Minnesota Vikings, and the Minnesota Twins.
2 CONT Enjoyed seeing the Las Vegas strip, Fremont Street, Shelby American museum, Las Vegas Motor Speedway, and many other sites during trips to Las Vegas.
2 CONT Owned many Ford Motor Company vehicles including: a 1963 Galaxie 500, an early 1965 Mustang, a 1972 Ranchero Squire, a 1979 Mustang Pace Car, a 1984 Bronco II, a 1992 Explorer Sport, a 1997 F-150 LeRoy's customs Truck, a 2013 Focu
2 CONC s ST, and a 2016 Focus RS. Also had a Capri and Karman-Ghia.
2 CONT Jerry C Gaard was proud to be 100 % Norwegian as both Conrad A Gaard and Seraphine G Larson have family genealogy tracing back to only Norway. Most of the Conrad A Gaard family lineage goes back to Rogaland, Norway and the Seraphi
2 CONC ne G Larson family lineage goes back to Sogn og Fjordane, Norway.
2 CONT Supporter of the Democratic Party.
2 CONT
2 CONT Doctors, nurses, and supporting staff at Mercy Hospital, Coon Rapids, MN, did everything they could to diagnose and treat what may have been going on. Was visited by Lutheran Pastor Mike at bedside. Passed away peacefully with son
2 CONC , Gavin, and close friend, Kelly, holding his hands.
2 CONT Miller Funeral Home, Fridley, Minnesota was responsible for the delicate and difficult cremation process. Love, care, and kindness was shown throughout this grieving time by the Miller Funeral Home staff. (https://www.millerfunera
2 CONC lfridley.com/)
2 CONT Celebration of Life held 9-25-21 at the Woodland Hills Funeral Home at the Indoor Mausoleum. In attendance: Gavin(son), Valoris(sister), Virgil(brother), Todd(nephew)-Denise, Brad(nephew)-Michelle, Barb, Steve-Danita(niece)-Cristi
2 CONC na, Belinda(niece), Doug-Jenny(niece)-Ryan, Sue
2 CONT Memorial/Bio info per Gavin Eric Gaard. I love you pops.
