1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Soul
2 CONT
2 CONT David Soul (born David Richard Solberg; August 28, 1943 – January 4, 2024) was an American-British actor and singer. He was known for his role as Detective Kenneth "Hutch" Hutchinson in the television series Starsky & Hutch from 1
2 CONC 975 to 1979; Joshua Bolt on Here Come the Brides from 1968 to 1970; and Officer John Davis in Magnum Force in 1973. As a singer, he scored one US hit and five UK hits with songs such as "Don't Give Up on Us" (US, CAN, & UK No. 1) 
2 CONC in 1976 and "Silver Lady" (UK No. 1) in 1977.
