1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jeff Graba''' is an American college gymnastics coach. He is currently the head coach of the Auburn Tigers women's gymnastics team and has been since 2010.
2 CONT
2 CONT Graba was born on December 26, 1968 in Wadena, Minnesota to parents Joseph, a trustee of Hamline University, and Sylvia (née Eide) Graba, an accountant. He has a twin brother, Jess, who owns Midwest Gymnastics. Graba was born in W
2 CONC adena but grew up in Forest Lake, Minnesota. He is a graduate of Forest Lake Area High School. ''(Wikipedia, CC BY-SA)''
2 CONT
