2 CONT
2 CONT Vernida Patricia Tekippe was born in Aug 1939. Vernida married Glenn Laverne Stockdale. The marriage ended in divorce on 5 Aug 1975. Glenn was born on 27 Aug 1931, died on 19 May 1994 in Dexter, Mower Co., Minnesota at age 62, and
2 CONC  was buried in Bethlehem Luthern Cemetery, Wykoff. They had five children. He served in the U.S. Marine Corps in Korea.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7-Jean Ann Stockdale was born on 26 Apr 1958 in Fillmore Co., Minnesota. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7-Mark Leo Stockdale was born on 2 Jan 1961 in Fillmore Co., Minnesota. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7-Janet Elaine Stockdale was born on 1 Dec 1963 in Fillmore Co., Minnesota. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7-La Verne Erie Stockdale was born on 13 Jan 1967 in Fillmore Co., Minnesota. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7-Michael Dean Stockdale was born on 24 Jun 1959 in Fillmore Co., Minnesota. Vernida next married David Dean Lageson. David was born on 14 Apr 1926 and died on 24 Dec 2007 in St. Mary's Hospital, Rochester at age 81. 
