2 CONT http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?indiv=1&db=mnbirth&h=8382631&new=1
2 CONT
2 CONT Linda Sharon  Winner
2 CONT
2 CONT GREENE — Linda Sharon Winner, 58, of Greene, passed away Wednesday (Oct. 4, 2006) at her home in Greene. Per her wishes, Linda was cremated.
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorial services will be held at 10:30 a.m. Wednesday, Oct. 11, 2006, at the Winner family residence located at 3080 Noble Ave. Greene, IA 50636.
2 CONT
2 CONT Linda is survived by her husband, Charles Winner, of Greene; one son, Chris (Pam) Maklenburg; two daughters, Lori (Alvin) Maklenburg, and Caron (Gary) Scott; six grandchildren, Michael McHenry, John Maklenburg, Sammi Heysquierdo, 
2 CONC Brianna Scott, Benjamin Scott, and Kaitlynn Scott.
2 CONT
2 CONT Linda was preceded in death by her parents, John and Emily Mihm; one son, James Maklenburg; one brother, and one sister.
2 CONT
2 CONT Linda Sharon Mihm was born on July 22, 1948, in Austin, Minn. and raised by John and Emily (Klingsheim) Mihm.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Charles Winner on Dec. 8, 1973 in Nashua, at The Little Brown Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Linda graduated from Cresco High School in Cresco, and attended two years of college.
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorials may be directed to the Winner family for a memorial of their choice.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services by the Cremation Society of Eastern-Central-Western Iowa.
